{"The cache key uses underscores as delimiters, but `name` and `parent` can themselves contain underscores. For example, `name=\"foo_bar\"`, `parent=\"baz\"` produces the same key as `name=\"foo\"`, `parent=\"bar_baz\"`, causing a cache collision that incorrectly denies access to an unrelated resource. Consider using a delimiter that cannot appear in the input values, or hash/sanitize the components.": 0.93663090467453}